# Components

## Template
```tsx
// 1 react · 2 third-party · 3 internal api/hooks · 4 internal components · 5 types · 6 constants
interface I{{Thing}}Props { … }
export const {{Thing}} = ({ … }: I{{Thing}}Props) => {
  // hooks first, then derived values, then handlers (handle*), then early returns for states
  if (isLoading) return <Skeleton … />;
  if (error) return <ErrorState onRetry={refetch} />;
  if (!items.length) return <EmptyState … />;
  return …;
};
```
- Every data component renders loading, empty, error, offline, success, permission-denied and partial states (`ux.md` §2).
- Props interfaces `I<Component>Props`; booleans `is/has/can/should`; handlers `handle*`.
- One component per file, ≤ ~300 lines; extract sub-components before that.

## Never
- Fetch inside presentational ui/ components
- inline styles or raw hex
- anonymous default exports
